de": 826, "direction": "out", "window": [3683, 42083]}, "result_digest": "9ffeadf6e3eaf740", "result_summary": "{\"direction\": \"out\", \"n_neighbors\": 2, \"neighbors\": [676, 1580], \"node\": 826, \"window\": [3683, 42083]}", "latency_ms": 1, "tokens_before": 23098, "tokens_after": 23098, "ok": true, "error": ""}, {"step_id": "step_16", "tool": "node_degree", "args": {"nodes": [749, 1572, 570, 1453, 826, 632, 765, 1045], "window": [3683, 42083]}, "result_digest": "8cef614c1aae3771", "result_summary": "{\"nodes\": [{\"distinct_partners\": 10, \"events\": 10, \"node\": 749}, {\"distinct_partners\": 2, \"events\": 2, \"node\": 1572}, {\"distinct_partners\": 10, \"events\": 10, \"node\": 570}, {\"distinct_partners\": 11, \"events\": 11, \"node\": 1453}, {\"distinct_partners\": 3, \"events\": 3, \"node\": 826}, {\"distinct_partners\": 9, \"events\": 9, \"node\": 632}, {\"distinct_partners\": 11, \"events\": 11, \"node\": 765}, {\"distinct_partners\": 6, \"events\": 6, \"node\": 1045}], \"window\": [3683, 42083]}", "latency_ms": 10, "tokens_before": 23098, "tokens_after": 23098, "ok": true, "error": ""}], "final_claim": {"task_id": "t_b3f77726", "decision": "absent", "mechanism": "cascade", "entities": [1885, 1460, 749, 1453, 1871, 632], "window": [3683, 42083], "confidence": 0.6, "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_05", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_06", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "confounder_control"}], "narrative": "Forward 2-hop expansion from 1885 and backward 2-hop expansion from 1460 intersect only at node 1871, implying the shortest static route is the 5-hop chain 1885->749->1453->1871->632->1460. Under a 600-unit per-hop constraint that chain would have to complete within ~2400 time units, yet 1885 emits only 5 events spread across the whole 38k window (none before ~12k) and every intermediary is similarly low-rate with essentially no repeated edges (repeat_ratio 0.017). The static connectivity and the general volume of activity are thus explained by a large, sparse, well-connected graph rather than by an actual time-respecting cascade; no \u03b4<=600 propagation path from 1885 to 1460 is supported."}, "raw_final_response": "## Analysis\n\n**Structural reachability (ignoring time).** Forward from 1885: out-neighbours {749, 1572} (step_05); 749 \u2192 {570, 1453} (step_09), 1572 \u2192 {826} (step_10); then 570 \u2192 {519, 875, 906} (step_13), 1453 \u2192 {221, 835, 1280, 1396, 1871} (step_14), 826 \u2192 {676, 1580} (step_15).\n\nBackward from 1460: in-neighbours {632, 765, 1045} (step_04); their in-neighbours are {161, 265, 1184, 1871} (step_06), {149, 1081, 1132, 1210, 1382} (step_07), {981, 1682, 1992} (step_08).\n\nThe **only** meeting point is node 1871, giving a single candidate chain 1885 \u2192 749 \u2192 1453 \u2192 1871 \u2192 632 \u2192 1460 \u2014 five hops. No shorter route exists.\n\n**Temporal feasibility.** With a 600-unit maximum gap, that whole five-hop chain must complete inside ~2400 time units. But 1885 is extremely sparse: 5 events across the whole 38 400-unit window, at most 2 in any 7 000-unit bucket, and none before t\u224812 000 (step_02, step_11). 1460's four events all fall in [12 001, 28 000] (step_12). The intermediate hubs (749, 1453, 632: 10\u201311 events each over the full window, step_16) are likewise low-rate, so each successive hop landing within 600 units of its predecessor is very unlikely, and the graph as a whole is near-non-repeating (repeat_ratio 0.017, step_01), so there are no repeated edges to supply alternative timings.\n\nThe connection therefore exists only in the *static*, time-ignored projection; the temporal structure gives no support for a \u03b4\u2264600 time-respecting chain.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_b3f77726\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1885, 1460, 749, 1453, 1871, 632],\n  \"window\": [3683, 42083],\n  \"confidence\": 0.6,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"Forward 2-hop expansion from 1885 and backward 2-hop expansion from 1460 intersect only at node 1871, implying the shortest static route is the 5-hop chain 1885->749->1453->1871->632->1460. Under a 600-unit per-hop constraint that chain would have to complete within ~2400 time units, yet 1885 emits only 5 events spread across the whole 38k window (none before ~12k) and every intermediary is similarly low-rate with essentially no repeated edges (repeat_ratio 0.017). The static connectivity and the general volume of activity are thus explained by a large, sparse, well-connected graph rather than by an actual time-respecting cascade; no \u03b4<=600 propagation path from 1885 to 1460 is supported.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 30837, "total_output_tokens": 4759, "total_tokens": 35596, "total_latency_ms": 59413, "llm_calls": 6, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}